<mxCell id="lg_m6" value="when needed" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F5F5F5;strokeColor=#666666;fontSize=9;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1220" y="222" width="205" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="notes" value="&lt;b&gt;Assumptions and marked additions&lt;/b&gt; (* = event not in the v0.2 catalogue: otp.requested, message.send_requested, whatsapp.message_received, notification.send_requested; added so WhatsApp, SMS and email flow through the integrations service) - gateway to identity-access API-key lookup (cached) is an assumption, not in the v0.2 RPC list - services start as 3 deployables (M0 to M2) and the rest appear with their milestone - phone-hash pepper is shared by crm, orders, scoring (only scoring stores the global layer) - databases are separate logical DBs on one PostgreSQL cluster at first - no service mesh in V1 (mTLS deferred) - gRPC load balancing needs a headless Service + client-side round-robin (spike S4) - SignalR scale-out uses the Valkey backplane." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFDE7;strokeColor=#F9A825;fontSize=10;align=left;spacingLeft=8;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="330" y="1930" width="2300" height="150" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
</root>
</mxGraphModel>
</diagram>
